  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NDali Horticultural Production and Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to enable the women s association to develop two hectares of land for improved vegetable production. The women will use a surface irrigation system which will improve their capacity to grow vegetables regardless of season.</narrative>
  </description>
